WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.132
A buyer who comes back wants to see their orders, their invoices and

00:00:05.132 --> 00:00:06.696
the things they saved.

00:00:06.696 --> 00:00:10.326
A buyer who never signs up still needs to find their order.

00:00:10.326 --> 00:00:14.849
This video shows the buyer's account, guest checkout, and how a guest finds

00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:17.250
an order or turns it into an account.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.834
Buyers come back to see where an order is, to print an invoice,

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:27.970
or to buy the same thing again.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:33.500
Many never want an account, and checking out as a guest keeps the sale easy.

00:00:34.250 --> 00:00:38.066
A guest still needs a way back to their order, without anyone else

00:00:38.066 --> 00:00:39.550
being able to read it.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.914
So signed-in buyers get an account, and guests get a secure link, a

00:00:44.914 --> 00:00:48.770
tracking page, and a way to find their orders by email.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:56.989
A signed-in buyer has My account, with a page for each feature the

00:00:56.989 --> 00:00:58.440
store has turned on.

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.288
A guest gets a link to their order on the confirmation page and

00:01:03.288 --> 00:01:05.188
in the confirmation email.

00:01:05.188 --> 00:01:06.970
It works for sixty days.

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:11.875
Track your order asks for the order number and the email together.

00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:14.010
Find my order emails the links.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:20.110
A guest can turn their orders into an account in one step, with the same email.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:27.321
Jamie signs in and opens My account.

00:01:27.321 --> 00:01:31.549
It has a page for each feature the store has turned on:

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:40.420
Orders, Wishlist, Payment methods, Balances and invoices, Addresses, Account details, Rewards, store credit and referrals.

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:45.836
Orders lists Jamie's orders, newest first, with the status and the total.

00:01:45.836 --> 00:01:51.052
Open one to see what was bought and when it was placed, and print its Invoice.

00:01:51.052 --> 00:01:55.399
An order waiting for payment has Pay now, and with Returns on, a

00:01:55.399 --> 00:01:57.510
paid order has Return items.

00:01:56.352 --> 00:02:01.695
Payment methods lists the cards Jamie saved at checkout, so Jamie can remove them.

00:02:01.695 --> 00:02:05.764
The cards are kept by the payment provider, not on your site.

00:02:05.764 --> 00:02:10.682
Balances and invoices shows what Jamie owes, and the invoices and receipts.

00:02:11.135 --> 00:02:16.091
With Wishlists on, Save to wishlist on a product's page keeps it for later.

00:02:16.091 --> 00:02:20.435
Under Wishlist, each saved product has its own Add to cart, and a

00:02:20.435 --> 00:02:23.495
product you stop selling drops off the list.

00:02:27.726 --> 00:02:30.502
A guest does not need an account to buy.

00:02:30.502 --> 00:02:34.002
Casey adds a watch to the cart, and clicks Checkout.

00:02:34.002 --> 00:02:38.105
Checkout asks for a name and an email, and for where the order

00:02:38.105 --> 00:02:40.941
goes, and then offers the shipping rates.

00:02:40.941 --> 00:02:45.346
Casey fills it in, and picks the standard rate, as any buyer would.

00:02:45.828 --> 00:02:48.515
Casey chooses to pay by bank transfer.

00:02:48.515 --> 00:02:52.912
The page shows the account to transfer to, and the order number to

00:02:52.912 --> 00:02:54.561
use as the reference.

00:02:54.561 --> 00:02:58.591
The order is placed now, and is paid when the money arrives.

00:02:58.591 --> 00:03:02.438
Casey clicks Pay now, and lands on the confirmation page.

00:03:02.889 --> 00:03:07.760
The confirmation page shows the order number, and a link to view the order.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.444
Casey keeps this link:

00:03:09.444 --> 00:03:13.594
it works for sixty days, and the confirmation email has it too.

00:03:13.594 --> 00:03:17.203
The page may also offer to make an account right away.

00:03:17.203 --> 00:03:21.894
Staff find the same order under Commerce, Orders, where it shows as paid

00:03:21.894 --> 00:03:24.059
once the transfer is recorded.

00:03:27.862 --> 00:03:30.450
Later, Casey cannot find the email.

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:36.069
Track your order asks for the order number and the email the order was placed with.

00:03:36.069 --> 00:03:39.541
Both must match, so a number alone shows nothing.

00:03:39.541 --> 00:03:44.402
Casey enters them, and sees the order, and its shipments once it ships.

00:03:44.854 --> 00:03:48.592
If Casey has lost the number too, Find my order asks only for

00:03:48.592 --> 00:03:51.716
the email, and emails a link to each recent order.

00:03:51.716 --> 00:03:55.510
It answers the same way whether or not there are orders, so it

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:58.244
never tells anyone who has bought from you.

00:03:58.694 --> 00:04:02.695
Casey opens the link from the email, and is back at the order.

00:04:02.695 --> 00:04:07.814
Link to both pages from your site's footer or help page, so guests can find them.

00:04:11.999 --> 00:04:14.557
Casey's order page has a line for guests:

00:04:14.557 --> 00:04:18.476
create an account with the same email to see this order and future

00:04:18.476 --> 00:04:19.945
ones in your account.

00:04:19.945 --> 00:04:21.959
Casey clicks Create an account.

00:04:22.411 --> 00:04:27.598
Casey chooses a user name and a password, with the same email, and registers.

00:04:27.598 --> 00:04:32.286
This link shows when your site lets visitors register, and a site can

00:04:32.286 --> 00:04:35.661
also ask new users to confirm their email first.

00:04:33.299 --> 00:04:37.791
Casey is signed in, and finds the guest order under Orders, along with

00:04:37.791 --> 00:04:40.569
every other order placed with that email.

00:04:44.769 --> 00:04:46.564
A shop of one-time buyers:

00:04:46.564 --> 00:04:50.769
guest checkout, and a link that always brings them back to the order.

00:04:51.519 --> 00:04:53.457
A store with regulars:

00:04:53.457 --> 00:04:59.269
an account with orders, invoices, a wishlist and saved addresses in one place.

00:05:00.019 --> 00:05:01.222
A support desk:

00:05:01.222 --> 00:05:05.519
ask for the order number and the email, or point to Track your order.

00:05:06.269 --> 00:05:08.406
Turning guests into accounts:

00:05:08.406 --> 00:05:12.679
offer a password on the confirmation page, right after the sale.

00:05:14.679 --> 00:05:19.315
With accounts and order links, every buyer can find their way back to

00:05:19.315 --> 00:05:21.972
an order, with or without signing up.

00:05:21.972 --> 00:05:23.579
Thanks for watching.

